	START_NODE -> "send to the receiving department"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_X0F3" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following description is about the account payable process. It begins when you send to the receiving department. 
When sending to the receiving department is completed, creating a receiving report should be done. 
When creating a receiving report is completed, gathering the receiving report needs to be done. 
After gathering the receiving report, the next tasks should be storing in paid invoice file and stamping all documents, they should be done in parallel. 
Once storing in paid invoice file occurs, the next tasks should be entering the invoice into the accounts payable account and scheduling the payment, they should be done in parallel. 
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following description is about the cashier - process which begins when you send to the receiving department.
Once the sending of an email to the receiving department is completed, a receiving report should be created.
When a receiving report is completed, the gathering of the receiving report must be done.
After gathering the Receiving Report, the next tasks should be storing in a paid invoice file and stamping all documents. They should be done in parallel
Once a payment is captured in the paid invoice file, the next tasks should be entering the invoice into the accounts payable and the payment - scheduling, they should be done in parallel.
The process is now completed.
"
}
